<title>GERMANY: Buba allots 75 bln dmk in repos at 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba allots 75 bln dmk in repos at 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday it allocated securities repurchase funds at this week's tender at a fixed three percent rate, the rate that has prevailed since late August.</p>
<p>The central bank accepted bids for 75 billion marks of the 13-day funds. A repo pact for 83.4 billion marks at a fixed three percent rate expires, so a net 8.4 billion marks was drained from the market.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank said it accepted 36.25 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
